## The issue scene

@narrator: Before the hub.
<hub id="desk">
  <choice id="take" text="Take it">
    @narrator: Taking it, then jumping past the hub.
    ::jump{to="after"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" text="Leave" exit>
    @narrator: Leaving.
  </choice>
</hub>
::label{name="after"}
@narrator: After the hub.

## Out of two hubs

<hub id="outer">
  <choice id="enter" text="Enter">
    <hub id="inner">
      <choice id="run" text="Run">
        @hero: Out of both.
        ::jump{to="outside"}
      </choice>
      <choice id="back" text="Back" exit>
        @hero: Back.
      </choice>
    </hub>
    @hero: Still in the outer hub.
  </choice>
  <choice id="go" text="Go" exit>
    @hero: Going.
  </choice>
</hub>
::label{name="outside"}
@narrator: Outside both hubs.

## Out of the inner hub only

<hub id="stairs">
  <choice id="climb" text="Climb">
    <hub id="landing">
      <choice id="rest" text="Rest">
        @hero: Resting, then on.
        ::jump{to="upstairs"}
      </choice>
      <choice id="stay" text="Stay" exit>
        @hero: Staying.
      </choice>
    </hub>
    ::label{name="upstairs"}
    @hero: Upstairs.
  </choice>
  <choice id="down" text="Down" exit>
    @hero: Down again.
  </choice>
</hub>

## Out of the return body

<hub id="table">
  <choice id="eat" text="Eat">
    @hero: Eating.
  </choice>
  <choice id="stand" text="Stand" exit>
    @hero: Standing.
  </choice>
  <return>
    @hero: Full.
    ::jump{to="fed"}
  </return>
</hub>
::label{name="fed"}
@narrator: Fed.

## A guarded leave that falls through

<hub id="door">
  <choice id="knock" text="Knock">
    @hero: Knocking.
    ::jump{to="opened" when="run.open"}
    @hero: No answer.
  </choice>
  <choice id="wait" text="Wait" exit>
    @hero: Waiting.
  </choice>
</hub>
::label{name="opened"}
@narrator: The end.
